This public source repository contains Gaius-authored source code, patches,
build scripts, version profiles, and metadata only.

Per repository policy, third-party-derived source overrides (TeaVM / Apache
Harmony, Gson, SLF4J, jopt-simple, LWJGL, mojang-logging), vendored test
fixtures (fake-indexeddb), and prebuilt shader toolchain artifacts are NOT
included in this source tree. They are obtained from upstream public sources
with SHA verification or generated locally at build time; see README.md for
upstream URLs, acquisition status, and recorded licenses.

The following external and build-time third-party components are referenced by
the build configuration, dependency locks, or local build pipeline. License
texts for reference are included in LICENSES/.

